- The facade cites [AB09, §1.7] for the amortized cost (minor 4).
- zoneRowPre_congr (across state types) and zoneRowPre_mapState_iff beside
  zoneRowPre; ZoneStep cites them in place of its private copy (minor 5).
- The equations' section comment names what it covers (note 10).

